  "worked_solution": "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \u27e8{e}^{-t},\\operatorname{tan}\u2061t\\operatorname{sec}\u2061t\u27e9\\,\\text{d}t & =\u27e8\\int {e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\operatorname{tan}\u2061t\\operatorname{sec}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-{e}^{-t}+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sec}\u2061t+{c}_{2}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-{e}^{-t},\\,\\operatorname{sec}\u2061t\u27e9+\u27e8{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-{e}^{-t},\\,\\operatorname{sec}\u2061t\u27e9+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
